# Lesson 41 — Database Configuration Example
# By default, for offline development without cloud credentials, we use a local SQLite file!
# To test cloud Neon PostgreSQL, replace provider="sqlite" with provider="postgresql" in schema.prisma and uncomment below:

DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEON POSTGRESQL CLOUD CONFIGURATION (Uncomment for Production / Neon DB)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:pass@ep-pooler.us-east-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require&pgbouncer=true&connect_timeout=15"
# DIRECT_URL="postgresql://user:pass@ep-direct.us-east-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"
